; Purpose: enforce read-only, offline checks across all Bootstrap child processes.
; Format: macOS Seatbelt profile, S-expressions; semicolon starts a line comment.
; (version 1) is required. Keep one expression per line for reviewability.
; Default actions are allowed; file-write* and network* are explicitly denied.
; /dev/null is the only write exception, for normal command output redirection.
; No package, HOME, repository, cache or migration path may receive a write exception.
; install.sh check loads this profile before executing Bootstrap, including preflight.
; A profile or sandbox failure must fail the check; there is no unsandboxed fallback.
; Example read-only maintenance: change a comment, then run tests/run.sh.

(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny file-write*)
(deny network*)
(allow file-write* (literal "/dev/null"))
